        "created_at": "2021-06-23T19:40:00.142Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well, maybe not <em>precisely</em> the right parents, but here we are.</p>\n<p>Iron Legacy interrupts a date between Young Legacy and Empowered Luminary at the Temple of Zhu Long. Also, since this is apparently Guise’s Fan-Fic, he’s there too.</p>\n<p>Good luck heroes!</p>\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
