        "raw": "Well, maybe not *precisely* the right parents, but here we are.\n\nIron Legacy interrupts a date between Young Legacy and Empowered Luminary at the Temple of Zhu Long. Also, since this is apparently Guise's Fan-Fic, he's there too.\n\nGood luck heroes!\n\n~A-Kat",
