        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-06-24T05:20:32.852Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint, and much closer than it probably should have been due to some reckless play, with Young Legacy actually taking herself out in the final round - so I replayed it, and won handily the second time, with all the heroes in the 20s, and the high and mighty Iron Legacy taken out…by a Shinobi Assassin, of all things!</p>",
